{"strongs": "H0520", "word": "אַמָּה", "translit": "am.mah", "root": "אמה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "ell, cubit", "definition": "II. אַמָּה 246 noun feminine ell, cubit ( SI אמה ; so Sabean DHM ZMG 1865, 613 ; Aramaic , אַמָּא ; Assyrian ammatu Nor 280 ; Ethiopic etymology dubious; Thes and others mater brachii , i.e. length of fore-arm; others derive from √ אמם , precede , be in front, & hence fore-arm compare Di Isa 6:4 Dl Pr 109 MV derive immediately from √ אמם be wide (see above), אַמָּה = distance , & hence a particular distance, ell, cubit ) — ׳ א absolute Gen 6:15 +; construct אַמַּת Deut 3:11 ; Jer 51:13 dual אַמָּתַיִם Exod 25:10 +; plural אַמּוֺת Exod 26:16 +; — 1. cubit , so אַמַּתאִֿישׁ i.e. ordinary cubit, Deut 3:11 (compare Isa 8:1 ); in Ezek 40:5 ; Ezek 43:13 is a cubit one hand-breadth longer, compare 2Chr 3:3 בַּמִּחָה הָרִאשׁוֺנָה ׳ א ; absolute length dubious, compare Smith Dict. Bib., article Weights and Measures ; Lepsius Längenmaasse der Alten, SBAk 1883,1195 f. identification with Egyptian, longer cubit. 525m., shorter .450m.; see also Id. Babylonian-Assyr. Längenmaasse 1877; MBAk 1877, 741 Oppert GGA 1878, 1055; Rev. d'Assyr. i. 124 (also on the Babylonian 'half-cubit' = .270 m. Hpt AJPh 1888, 419 Hom Semiten i. 501 ); on אַצִּילָה ׳ א Ezek 41:8 compare Sm & Co ( Co strike out); חֲמֵשׁ אמות קָנִים Ezek 42:16 Kt , read מֵאוֺת so Qr Co ; chiefly in Ex 25-27. 36-38 (56 t.) 1Kgs 6 . 7 (45 t.) 2Chr 3 .4 (21 t.) Ezek 40-43 (86 t.); a (one) cubit = אַמָּה Gen 6:16 ; Exod 25:10 ; Exod 25:23 +; הָאַמָּה Ezek 43:14 אַחַת ׳ א Ezek 40:12 (twice in verse); Ezek 40:42 (3 t. in verse); Ezek 42:4 ; Ezek 43:14 two cubits = אַמָּתַיִם Exod 25:10 ; Exod 25:17 ; Exod 25:23 ; Exod 30:2 ; Exod 37:1 ; Exod 37:6 ; Exod 37:10 ; Exod 37:25 ; Num 11:31 שְׁתַּיִם אַמּוֺת Ezek 40:9 ; Ezek 41:3 ; Ezek 41:22 ; Ezek 43:14 with numbers 1-10 ׳ א mostly follows number in plural Exod 26:16 ; Exod 27:1 (3 t. in verse); 1Kgs 6:10 ; Ezek 40:5 ; Ezek 40:7 ; Ezek 40:9 +; with numbers 11-1000 +, it mostly following number in singular Gen 6:15 (3 t. in verse); Exod 27:12 ; Exod 27:13 ; Exod 38:13 ; Exod 38:14 ; Exod 38:15 ; Num 35:4 ; Josh 3:4 ; 1Kgs 6:2 (twice in verse); 1Kgs 6:3 ; 1Kgs 7:15 (twice in verse); Jer 52:21 ; Jer 52:22 ; Ezek 40:49 (twice in verse) +; seldom following, in plural Ezek 40:11 (strike out Co ) v Ezek 40:27 ( Co singular) Ezek 42:2 so also עֶשְׂרִים וְחָמֵשׁ אַמּוֺת Ezek 40:13 ; Ezek 40:29 but חָמֵשׁ וְעֶשְׂרִים אַמָּה Ezek 40:25 ; Ezek 40:30 ; Ezek 40:33 ; Ezek 40:36 (late) also in plural precedes all numbers 2Chr 3:3 (twice in verse); 2Chr 3:4 ; 2Chr 3:8 (twice in verse) +; 2Chr 6:13 ; Ezek 42:2 also often בָּאַמָּה following all numbers Exod 26:2 (twice in verse); Exod 26:8 (twice in verse); Exod 27:9 ; Exod 27:18 ; Exod 36:9 (twice in verse); Exod 36:15 (twice in verse); Exod 36:21 ; Num 35:5 (4 t. in verse); 1Kgs 6:6 (3 t. in verse); 1Kgs 7:23 (3 t. in verse); 2Chr 4:2 (3 t. in verse); Ezek 40:21 ; Ezek 47:3 ; Zech 5:2 (twice in verse) +, compare לְאַמּוֺת חָמֵשׁ 2Chr 3:11 often וַחֲצִי ׳ א Exod 25:10 (3 t. in verse); Exod 25:17 (twice in verse) +, also ׳ וַחֲצִי הָא ׳ א Exod 26:16 ; Exod 36:21 ; Exod 1:31 ; 1Kgs 17:32 ; 1Kgs 17:35 etc.; compare שֵׁשׁ אַמּוֺת וָזָרֶ֑ת 1Sam 17:4 followed by בַּמִּדָּה in measurement Josh 3:4 ; 2Chr 3:3 . 2. measure , full measure, limit, only אַמַּת בִּצְעֵךְ the measure of thy gain-making Jer 51:13 (|| קִצֵּךְ ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB522')\">BDB522</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H520')\">H520</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB521')\">BDB521</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB523')\">BDB523</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>אַמָּה</bdbheb><sub>246</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>ell, cubit</highlightword> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SI')\"><reflink>SI</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>אמה</bdbheb>; so Sabean <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ZMG 1865, 613</sup></lookup>;